# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:13723 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Sidney_park_activities_a87ec360:
msgid "[_MS_] Not only did you rescue me, but you also helped that poor old man."
msgstr "Ты не только спас меня, но и помог этому бедному старику."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:13724 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Sidney_park_activities_ada889d0:
msgid "[_MS_] The poor thing's been surviving off of the land for weeks."
msgstr "[ _MS_] Бедняга выжила с земли в течение нескольких недель."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:13727 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Sidney_park_activities_9cc9275e:
msgid "[_MS_] I sure hope they give you some kind of medal."
msgstr "Надеюсь, они дадут тебе какую-то медаль."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:13728 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Sidney_park_activities_b9871172:
msgid "[_R_] Oh, don't be silly. I don't deserve a medal."
msgstr "Не глупи. Я не заслуживаю медали."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:13729 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Sidney_park_activities_d45a24be:
msgid "[_MS_] Oh, and you're so humble."
msgstr "О, и ты такой скромный."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:13733 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Sidney_park_activities_0f365492:
msgid "[_S_] Sorry to interrupt, but shouldn't we be getting home?"
msgstr "[_S_] Приносим извинения за прерывание, но не должны ли мы возвращаться домой?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:13734 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Sidney_park_activities_152e64b9:
msgid "[_ST_] {i}This bitch better back off my [ryan].{/i}"
msgstr "[_ST_] {i}Этот бит лучше обратно с моей [ryan].{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:13737 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Sidney_park_activities_7cf31ca8:
msgid "[_MS_] And who might this be?"
